cause I like winter make snowman."},{"key":"C","text":"I like winter because I can make a snowman."},{"key":"D","text":"I like winter because I can making a snowman."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"because + 完整句。","verify":"\"I like winter because I can make a snowman.\""},{"id":"cne_p261_q4","topicId":"cne_p261","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：—Why do you like autumn? —Because it is cool and golden. 喜欢秋天的原因是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"没有理由"},{"key":"B","text":"凉爽又金黄"},{"key":"C","text":"很热"},{"key":"D","text":"可以游泳"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"cool and golden。","verify":"\"凉爽又金黄\""},{"id":"cne_p262_q1","topicId":"cne_p262","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I like summer best because I can swim. 最喜欢哪个季节？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"夏天"},{"key":"B","text":"春天"},{"key":"C","text":"秋天"},{"key":"D","text":"冬天"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"summer。","verify":"\"夏天\""},{"id":"cne_p262_q2","topicId":"cne_p262","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Winter is white. I can make a snowman. 冬天可以做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"游泳"},{"key":"B","text":"摘苹果"},{"key":"C","text":"种花"},{"key":"D","text":"堆雪人"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"make a snowman。","verify":"\"堆雪人\""},{"id":"cne_p262_q3","topicId":"cne_p262","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：My favourite season is spring. There are pretty flowers. 哪一句一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"最喜欢冬天。"},{"key":"B","text":"夏天有雪。"},{"key":"C","text":"春天有漂亮的花。"},{"key":"D","text":"春天没有花。"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"pretty flowers。","verify":"\"春天有漂亮的花。\""},{"id":"cne_p262_q4","topicId":"cne_p262","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Amy likes autumn because she can pick apples. Tom likes winter because he can ski. 谁喜欢秋天？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"谁都不喜欢"},{"key":"B","text":"艾米"},{"key":"C","text":"汤姆"},{"key":"D","text":"两人都喜欢"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Amy likes autumn。","verify":"\"艾米\""}]
